  "notes_2024": "June 2024 Medical-Dental Fee Schedule (fee-schedule0624, posted 2024-06-13 in the same OHA DataReportsDocs library linked from the fee schedule page; no 0724/0824 edition was published). Every requested dental code has identical price and effective date in the September 2024 edition (fee-schedule0924.xlsx, posted 2024-09-20), so these fees were in force on 2024-07-01. Per-code effective dates: mostly 20110801 / 20180201 (D2740 20220101, D7241 20231001, D8080 and D8680 20240101). 'Manual' (manual pricing) in 2024: D3346, D8070, D8090, D8670, D9222, D9223, D9239. OHP dental FFS rates were raised substantially on 2025-01-01 and 2026-01-01 (e.g. D1110 40.89 -> 73.28). effective_date_2024 = posting date of the edition."
